 up a custom domain. First team to complete all four wins.\n\n**What to expect:**\nA Kahoot to kick off the hands-on section, a live guided build where everyone follows along, a team challenge with actual stakes, and a room full of people figuring things out together.\n**And yes — merch is dropping.** AWS SBG gear will be at this event for the first time. Winners of the challenge get first pick.\n\nFood's covered. Bring your laptop. Set up your AWS Free tier account now.\n\n**DATE TBD, expected early Octobe**r **· Helix Room, K Building, Newnham Campus**","eventType":"PHYSICAL","eventUrl":"https://www.meetup.com/aws-sbg-at-seneca-polytechnic-newnham-campus/events/316658151/","isAttending":false,"isSaved":false,"maxTickets":0,"rsvpState":"JOIN_OPEN","featuredEventPhoto":{"__ref":"PhotoInfo:536283040"},"displayPhoto":{"__ref":"PhotoInfo:536283040"},"feeSettings":null,"group":{"__ref":"Group:38530463"},"socialProofInsights":null,"rsvps":{"__typename":"RsvpConnection","totalCount":7,"edges":[{"__typename":"RsvpEdge","node":{"__typename":"Rsvp","isHost":true,"member":{"__ref":"Member:481392393"}}},{"__typename":"RsvpEdge","node":{"__typename":"Rsvp","isHost":true,"member":{"__ref":"Member:416884311"}}},{"__typename":"RsvpEdge","node":{"__typename":"Rsvp","isHost":false,"member":{"__ref":"Member:480274455"}}},{"__typename":"RsvpEdge","node":{"__typename":"Rsvp","isHost":false,"member":{"__ref":"Member:483751717"}}},{"__typename":"RsvpEdge","node":{"__typename":"Rsvp","isHost":false,"member":{"__ref":"Member:483846478"}}},{"__typename":"RsvpEdge","node":{"__typename":"Rsvp","isHost":false,"member":{"__ref":"Member:484179162"}}},{"__typename":"RsvpEdge","node":{"__typename":"Rsvp","isHost":false,"member":{"__ref":"Member:397426098"}}}]},"series":null,"venue":{"__typename":"Venue","name":"1750 Finch Avenue East","address":"1750 Finch Ave E, North York, ON M2J 5G3, Canada","city":"Toronto","state":"ON","country":"ca"}},"RecommendedEventsEdge:{\"node\":{\"id\":\"316658151\"}}"