ed at **1481 Gerrard St East.** We'll be in the back of the café around a big table, ready to welcome you.\n\nWe'll be practicing the French language and making friends, **keeping in mind that every 45 minutes we'll be moving around to mix up the conversation.** Everyone is welcome, whatever your level.\n\nTo find out more about the cafe and its delicious and varied menu: https://www.blogto.com/restaurants/black-pony-toronto/\n\nWhy the $3 fee? It helps cover the cost of hosting the group on the Meetup platform for the current year and previous years. We ask participants to contribute **$3.00 at each event**. Vishnu will be there to collect contributions, so please bring change.\n\nIf you prefer, you can use this Square link:\n[CLICK HERE](https://square.link/u/S6dAAKd1)\n\nThank you,\nVishnu","eventType":"PHYSICAL","eventUrl":"https://www.meetup.com/frenchmeetup/events/316687657/","isSaved":false,"maxTickets":25,"rsvpState":"JOIN_OPEN","featuredEventPhoto":{"__ref":"PhotoInfo:530044143"},"displayPhoto":{"__ref":"PhotoInfo:530044143"},"feeSettings":{"__typename":"EventFeeSettings","accepts":"CASH","currency":"CAD","amount":3},"socialProofInsights":null,"rsvps":{"__typename":"RsvpConnection","totalCount":15,"edges":[{"__typename":"RsvpEdge","node":{"__typename":"Rsvp","isHost":true,"member":{"__ref":"Member:412956549"}}},{"__typename":"RsvpEdge","node":{"__typename":"Rsvp","isHost":false,"member":{"__ref":"Member:472820085"}}},{"__typename":"RsvpEdge","node":{"__typename":"Rsvp","isHost":false,"member":{"__ref":"Member:469746706"}}},{"__typename":"RsvpEdge","node":{"__typename":"Rsvp","isHost":false,"member":{"__ref":"Member:416530373"}}},{"__typename":"RsvpEdge","node":{"__typename":"Rsvp","isHost":false,"member":{"__ref":"Member:368268919"}}},{"__typename":"RsvpEdge","node":{"__typename":"Rsvp","isHost":false,"member":{"__ref":"Member:374868019"}}},{"__typename":"RsvpEdge","node":{"__typename":"Rsvp","isHost":false,"member":{"__ref":"Member:264481551"}}},{"__typena